<title>FRANCE: Bodies of 60 dolphins swept ashore in France.</title>
<headline>Bodies of 60 dolphins swept ashore in France.</headline>
<dateline>BORDEAUX, France 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sixty dead dolphins were swept ashore on Atlantic beaches near this southwest France city at the weekend, police said.</p>
<p>Officials said they believed the dolphins may have died after becoming snared in the nets of trawlers.</p>
<p>Their bodies would have been blown ashore afterwards by strong winds.</p>
